# TG-04 stage B: tgd and tg installed from the volume's /packages with their saved grants, on
# the console (make test-tg-socket's first boot, and make tg-install before run-tg-login).
# Only the console's shell holds the volume's root, which install needs: a terminal of the
# desktop holds what home gives (ADR-0242's condition). Then each program's page lists
# exactly what it holds, and the machine is turned off; the desktop boots on this volume.
# @GRANT@ is the line of tgd --install-line (tests/expand_script.py).
! panicked
! first process ended
< Type help to begin, or help tour.
< \r\n~>
> @GRANT@\r
limit 300 < tgd installed with:
<   ~/.config/tgd  its own files
<   net: openrouter.ai:443  reach
< \r\n~>
> install /packages/tg +sock /data/home/tgd/window.sock\r
< tg installed with:
<   /data/home/tgd/window.sock  connect to
< \r\n~>
> programs tgd\r
< tgd is an installed program, /apps/tgd/tgd (sha256
< saved grants:
^ \r\n  +own ~/.config/tgd  ~/.config/tgd  its own files (saved)
^ \r\n  +net 91.108.56.0/22:443  net: 91.108.56.0/22:443  reach (saved)
^ \r\n  +net 91.108.4.0/22:443  net: 91.108.4.0/22:443  reach (saved)
^ \r\n  +net 91.108.8.0/22:443  net: 91.108.8.0/22:443  reach (saved)
^ \r\n  +net 91.108.16.0/22:443  net: 91.108.16.0/22:443  reach (saved)
^ \r\n  +net 91.108.12.0/22:443  net: 91.108.12.0/22:443  reach (saved)
^ \r\n  +net 149.154.160.0/20:443  net: 149.154.160.0/20:443  reach (saved)
^ \r\n  +net 91.105.192.0/23:443  net: 91.105.192.0/23:443  reach (saved)
^ \r\n  +net 91.108.20.0/22:443  net: 91.108.20.0/22:443  reach (saved)
^ \r\n  +net 185.76.151.0/24:443  net: 185.76.151.0/24:443  reach (saved)
^ \r\n  +net openrouter.ai:443  net: openrouter.ai:443  reach (saved)
^ \r\nrunning: none
< \r\n~>
> programs tg\r
< tg is an installed program, /apps/tg/tg (sha256
< saved grants:
^ \r\n  +sock /data/home/tgd/window.sock  /data/home/tgd/window.sock  connect to (saved)
^ \r\nrunning: none
< \r\n~>
# Neither is given the current directory (cwd none, R28): grants shows no row for it.
> grants tg\r
< tg gets:
< \r\n~>
x current directory
> grants tgd --window\r
< tgd gets (a POSIX program):
< \r\n~>
x current directory
x power off
> poweroff\r
